    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 670 of the laws of 2007 amending the education law\nrelating to directing the commissioner of education to promulgate regulations\nlimiting the engines of school vehicles to remain idling while parked or\nstanding on school grounds, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S2890",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S2890-2019",
    "coSponsors": {
